        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMRC44-DYL, Marcel Entry Door Handleset with Dylan Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Marcel Entry Set with Dylan Knob is available in the most popular finishes for this year. This stylish, modern handleset comes packaged as a complete set to fit many standard pre-drilled doors. This front door lock has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. It comes with the Dylan knob--a truly gorgeous knob that will sure to add modern appeal to your front door. The Marcel Entry Door Handleset with Dylan Knob is a single cylinder handleset and can be keyed alike to all your Schlage C Keyway locks.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Yale Marcel Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Center to Center Door Prep: 5-1/2\"</l>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-5/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-7/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Specs: 2-1/8” face bore, 1” edge bore, 1” x 2-1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMRC44-DYL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262432\"><b>Yale YMRC44-DYL Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
