                "description": "The Marcel Entry Set with Dylan Knob is available in the most popular finishes for this year. This stylish, modern handleset comes packaged as a complete set to fit many standard pre-drilled doors. This front door lock has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. It comes with the Dylan knob--a truly gorgeous knob that will sure to add modern appeal to your front door. The Marcel Entry Door Handleset with Dylan Knob is a single cylinder handleset and can be keyed alike to all your Schlage C Keyway locks.",
